{"schema_version":"0.1.0","profile":{"id":"compat.cpg","version":"0.1.0"},"layout":"bundled","document":"unit","producer":{"name":"rstyle-cxx","version":"0.1.0","namespace":"cxx"},"coverage":{"capabilities":{"aliasing":{"status":"approximated","description":"places record writes and mutable borrows, with what a reference or pointer reaches marked as escaping; reads have no places, and what two pointers share isn't tracked"},"constant-values":{"status":"approximated","description":"literals, enumerators and integer constants read where they're used; other constant expressions are not evaluated"},"dispatch":{"status":"approximated","description":"a virtual call is dynamic, and names an implementation only where Clang can devirtualize it"},"evaluation-order":{"status":"approximated","description":"the CFG follows C++17 where it specifies an order, and left to right where the language leaves it unspecified, as for function arguments"},"exceptional-flow":{"status":"approximated","description":"throw, and calls in a try's body, have edges to its handlers; a call outside any try has no exception edge, and destructors running during unwinding aren't shown"},"generic-instances":{"status":"unsupported","description":"a template's body is emitted once from its pattern; instances are not recorded"},"implicit-calls":{"status":"supported","description":"implicit conversions, constructors and destructors are calls the compiler writes, where they run: a scope's end, before a jump out of one, and a temporary's full expression. A conditional temporary's is counted as if it were made, a local a return elides still gets one, what runs during unwinding isn't shown, and what a template hasn't settled is an unresolved call"},"integer-semantics":{"status":"approximated","description":"widths and signedness come from Clang; unsigned overflow wraps, and signed overflow is undefined, so a bound holds for executions without it"},"lifetimes":{"status":"unknown","description":"no checker establi